{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "mom6_surface_forcing",
  "description": "Stage-2 implementation of the MOM6 surface forcing import-to-fluxes/forces mapping (stage 1 boundary I of stage1/runs/MOM6_LANE.md; MOM6 dev/ncar_260909 @301879336, fork stage1/EqESM-cesm-mom6 branch instrument/mom6-dumps): the per-column mapping from the imported coupler fields (x_in, 25 fields gathered by the driver) to the MOM6 forcing fluxes (convert_IOB_to_fluxes, mom_surface_forcing_nuopc.F90:258-734) and mechanical forces (convert_IOB_to_forces, :739-1050), plus the net mass source (set_net_mass_forcing, MOM_forcing_type.F90:2748-2800), all with the unit conversions of the reference run (C_JRA_t62_mom6_inst: every conversion factor 1.0, so the laws below are pure arithmetic). All fluxes/forces are pass-throughs of the imports except: sw = sw_vis_dir + sw_vis_dif + sw_nir_dir + sw_nir_dif (:597); latent = q_flux*Lv - fprec*Lf - frunoff*Lf - frunoff_glc*Lf with Lv = 2.501e6 and Lf = 3.337e5 J kg-1 (:572-596); the latent heat diagnostics latent_evap_diag = q_flux*Lv, latent_fprec_diag = -fprec*Lf, latent_frunoff_diag = -frunoff*Lf; vprec = vprec_restore - net_fw_global_adjust (SRESTORE_AS_SFLUX=True so the restoring freshwater flux is 0, and ADJUST_NET_FRESH_WATER_TO_ZERO=True subtracts the area-mean net fresh-water flux; :455-486, :694-714); salt_flux_o = salt_flux + salt_restore_flux (:430-447, :686-689); the mechanical forces with wind_stagger = AGRID (taux/tauy are the h-point stress averages onto the u/v points east/north of the cell, :943-951, while tau_mag = GUST_CONST + sqrt(u_flux^2 + v_flux^2), ustar = sqrt(tau_mag/RHO_0) and omega_w2x = atan2(v_flux, u_flux) are built from the h-point stresses directly, :956-962); and net_mass_src, the nine-term sum of the water fluxes. GUST_CONST = 4.0e-4 Pa, RHO_0 = 1035.0 kg m-3, Lf and Lv as above. The restoring salt flux and the net-FW adjustment are ocean-state-driven fields, not IOB imports, so they enter as inputs (the dump records them as salt_flux_o - salt_flux_in and -vprec). The tests pin the stage-1 instrumentation dump mom6_sfc_forcing.csv (12 traced cells x 12 coupling steps; the rows below cover ocean and land east/north neighbors of the AGRID averages and the runoff/melt/evaporation branches). The dump writes es26.17; the run is r8, so the transcriptions are pinned to round-off (rel 1e-12). The u10_sqr import is never used: the reference run does not allocate fluxes%u10_sqr (:644-645), so u10_sqr_o is identically 0 (u10_sqr_allocated = 0).",
  "authors": [
   "EqESM stage 2 (wt/mom6-eos)"
  ]
 },
 "models": {
  "SurfaceForcing": {
   "variables": {
    "p": {
     "type": "parameter",
